<title>FINLAND: TIETO, SOFOR TO COOPERATE ON LOTUS NOTES.</title>
<headline>TIETO, SOFOR TO COOPERATE ON LOTUS NOTES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data systems group TT Tieto Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it would start cooperating with Sofor Oy on Lotus Notes expertise.</p>
<p>&quot;The agreement aims to make sure there are enough Lotus Notes specialists for the needs of large Finnish clients,&quot; TT Tieto said, adding that the two partners would have 50 such experts together.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
